<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Meredith EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Meredith EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Gruntal &amp; Co said Thursday it increased slightly its earnings per share estimates on Meredith Corp to $1.21 from $1.19 for FY97 and to $1.25 from $1.23 for FY98.</p>
<p>--&quot;We believe the company is set to turn in healthy increases in revenue (13 percent) and cash flow (35 percent) in the coming year,&quot; analyst Rita Zanella said in a report.</p>
<p>--Meredith was off 7/8 at 22-7/8.</p>
<p>	  ((Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
